---

const stack = ["Laravel", "Node.js", "Kotlin", "Jetpack Compose", "Docker", "PostgreSQL", "React", "Next.js"];
---

<section class="w-full bg-background3 px-[4%] py-20" id="kredibilitas">
  <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
      <p class="font-poppins text-sm text-color-main">Kapasitas teknis</p>
      <h2 class="font-plusjakartaregular text-2xl font-bold text-font-white sm:text-[32px]">
        Tim fullstack yang merancang sistem supaya bisa dirawat
      </h2>
      <p class="font-poppins text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75 sm:text-base">
        Kami mengerjakan dari dua sisi. Arsitektur backend disusun dengan Laravel atau Node.js. Aplikasi Android native dibangun dengan Kotlin dan Jetpack Compose supaya alurnya tetap mulus di perangkat pengguna.
      </p>
      <p class="font-poppins text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75 sm:text-base">
        Untuk infrastruktur, kami memakai container Docker dan database PostgreSQL. Tujuannya sederhana: lingkungan yang bisa diulang, data yang konsisten, dan serah terima yang tidak tergantung satu laptop developer.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {stack.map((item) => (
          <li class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 font-poppins text-sm text-font-white">{item}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
      <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#2C2B2B]">
        <img class="h-52 w-full object-contain object-bottom sm:h-64" src="/asset/image/mizzy.png" alt="Mizzy, fullstack developer" />
        <figcaption class="px-2 py-3 text-center">
          <p class="font-poppins text-sm font-bold text-font-white">Mizzy</p>
          <p class="font-poppins text-[11px] text-color-main">Fullstack</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#2C2B2B]">
        <img class="h-52 w-full object-contain object-bottom sm:h-64" src="/asset/image/eka.png" alt="Eka, mobile developer" />
        <figcaption class="px-2 py-3 text-center">
          <p class="font-poppins text-sm font-bold text-font-white">Eka</p>
          <p class="font-poppins text-[11px] text-color-main">Mobile</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#2C2B2B]">
        <img class="h-52 w-full object-contain object-bottom sm:h-64" src="/asset/image/naufal.png" alt="Naufal, UI dan frontend" />
        <figcaption class="px-2 py-3 text-center">
          <p class="font-poppins text-sm font-bold text-font-white">Naufal</p>
          <p class="font-poppins text-[11px] text-color-main">UI & Frontend</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
